# Platform folders are generated by `flutter create` (see README.md) and are
# intentionally not hand-written, so there's nothing of ours to ignore inside
# them yet — this repo has no android/ or ios/ directory at all right now.

# Signing material must never reach source control (docs/mobile/SECURITY-DESIGN.md §10).
**/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.mobileprovision
**/*.p12
